SEL: ``.CID`` files (e.g. ``SET_61850.CID``) are now parsed as IEC 61850 SCL (``peat.modules.sel.sel_scl``). The IED, its access points, logical devices, GOOSE and Sampled Value control blocks and addresses, and the IED name, type, and configuration version from the ``ID`` command are saved in ``extra.iec61850``, with an ``iec61850`` (MMS, TCP 102) service and the related IP and MAC addresses. A warning is logged if the values from the ``ID`` command and the SCL are different.
